   {
    "card": {
     "title": "When will the world's population peak?"
    }
   },
   {
    "draw": [
     "axes",
     "line_1",
     "now_l"
    ],
    "voice": "a",
    "speak": "When will the world's population stop growing? Since 1950 it has more than tripled, to eight point two billion. Your guess, and my co-host's."
   },
   {
    "draw": [
     "yr"
    ],
    "voice": "b",
    "speak": "Easy, I'll go first: it never stops. Twenty-two hundred, at the earliest."
   },
   {
    "ask": {
     "question": "Click on the line where you think the peak comes.",
     "on": "yr",
     "store": "y",
     "default": "2120",
     "tolerance": 0.06,
     "right": "Close: you said {y}, and the UN says {y.true}.",
     "wrong": "You said {y}; the UN's answer is {y.true}."
    }
   },
   {
    "highlight": {
     "target": [
      "yr"
     ]
    },
    "voice": "a",
    "speak": "Sorry. The UN's projection says 2084."
   },
   {
    "erase": [
     "yr"
    ],
    "voice": "b",
    "speak": "Fine. But at the top it'll be huge. Fifteen billion?"
   },
   {
    "hide": [
     "axes",
     "line_1",
     "now_l"
    ]
   },
   {
    "ask": {
     "question": "And how many people at the peak? Drag the slider.",
     "estimate": {
      "min": 8,
      "max": 16,
      "value": 10.3,
      "unit": "billion"
     },
     "store": "p",
     "default": "12",
     "relative": true,
     "tolerance": 0.06,
     "right": "Close: you said {p} billion, and it is about {p.true}.",
     "wrong": "You said {p} billion; it is about {p.true}."
    }
   },
   {
    "erase": [
     "estimate_1"
    ]
   },
   {
    "show": [
     "axes",
     "line_1",
     "now_l"
    ]
   },
   {
    "animate": {
     "box.x": 70,
     "box.y": 195,
     "box.w": 860,
     "box.h": 430
    },
    "duration": 2
   },
   {
    "draw": [
     "line_2",
     "peak_pt",
     "peak_l"
    ],
    "voice": "a",
    "speak": "Ten point three, so two billion more than today. After the peak, a slow decline."
   },
   {
    "highlight": {
     "target": [
      "line_2"
     ]
    },
    "voice": "b",
    "speak": "But people have fewer kids now. Why does it keep growing?"
   },
   {
    "draw": [
     "kid_tick",
     "kid_l"
    ],
    "voice": "a",
    "speak": "They do. In fact the number of children under five already peaked, back in 2017."
   },
   {
    "highlight": {
     "target": [
      "kid_l"
     ]
    },
    "voice": "b",
    "speak": "Wait. Fewer babies, but more people?"
   },
   {
    "draw": [
     "fill_l"
    ],
    "voice": "a",
    "speak": "Yes: today's children still have to grow up, and more of us live to old age. The total catches up later."
   },
   {
    "highlight": {
     "target": [
      "peak_pt"
     ],
     "effect": "circle"
    },
    "voice": "b",
    "speak": "So the babies peaked first, and the rest of us follow in 2084. I was off by a century."
